Subject: [PATCH] cg_clif: use clif-to-wasm from crates.io

clif-to-wasm 0.1.0 is published, so the in-tree cg_clif depends on it
from crates.io instead of a sibling checkout by path. It needs Cranelift
0.137.1, so the lockfile moves the Cranelift crates from 0.137.0, and
wasm-encoder to 0.263.
